@* MainLayoutSider — NoAuth project variant. No Authentication module installed, so there is NO
   AuthorizeView, no CascadingAuthenticationState, and no auth-conditional rendering anywhere
   in this file. Every item renders unconditionally, in the order given by the context.

   The outer <nav class="ux-nav-drawer"> wrapper is the current scaffold's shape — there is no
   MudDrawer/DrawerOpen/DrawerOpenChanged binding here (an older scaffold generation used one;
   it no longer exists in MainLayout.razor or the code-behind, so don't reintroduce it). *@

<nav class="ux-nav-drawer">
    <MudNavMenu>
        <MudNavLink Href="/" Match="NavLinkMatch.All" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Home">Home</MudNavLink>
        <MudNavLink Href="/product-list" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Inventory2">Product List</MudNavLink>
        <MudNavLink Href="/order-list" Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ListAlt">Order List</MudNavLink>
    </MudNavMenu>
</nav>
